  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Multi-sectoral HIV Implementation and Coordination in Eswatini Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the enhancing multi-sectoral HIV implementation and coordination in Eswatini activity is to support the locally led coordination, management, and implementation of comprehensive HIV and related health and social services to attain and sustain HIV epidemic control in Eswatini.</narrative>
  </description>
